%% Civic Signal style: a clear flow diagram for interview explanation and README documentation.
flowchart LR
  Browser[Resident browser]
  App[App.tsx\nTheme + route + toast]
  Shell[Home.tsx\nresponsive workspace shell]
  Data[societyData.ts\ntyped mock repository]
  State[React local state\nuseState + derived views]
  Views[Feature views\nnotices / requests / events / facilities / directory / polls / visitors]
  Feedback[Toast + empty states\nvalidation + status tags]
  Future[(Production API + database\nauth + roles + notifications)]

  Browser --> App
  App --> Shell
  Shell --> Data
  Shell --> State
  State --> Views
  Data --> Views
  Views --> Feedback
  Views -. future replacement .-> Future
  Future -. validated responses .-> State
